title: "CAZy-HABench30K: Reproducibility Code for Homology-Aware CAZy Enzyme Family Classification"
abstract: "Reproducibility repository for CAZy-HABench30K, including code for the accepted ESM-2+Mean+MTL benchmark study and the under-review HierESM hierarchy-constrained protein language model study."
